@startuml
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram - Relatório de Médicos (Admin)

actor "Administrador" as Admin
participant "Doctors-Service" as Docs
participant "Appointments-Service" as Appts
database "Doctors DB\n(MongoDB)" as DocDB

autonumber

Admin -> Docs: GET /physicians/admin/top\n(Top Médicos por Consultas)
activate Docs

    Note right of Docs: Validação de Segurança\n@PreAuthorize("hasRole('ADMIN')")

    alt Estratégia A: Dados Locais (Event Driven)
        Docs -> DocDB: Find All SortBy(totalAppointments)
        Note right of Docs: Leitura rápida no MongoDB\n(Dados atualizados via RabbitMQ)
        Docs -> Docs: Map to DTO
    else Estratégia B: Dados em Tempo Real (Sync)
        Docs -> Appts: GET /appointments/statistics/top-physicians
        activate Appts
            Appts -> Appts: Calculate from SQL
            Appts --> Docs: List<TopPhysicianDTO>
        deactivate Appts
    end

    Docs --> Admin: 200 OK (Lista JSON)

deactivate Docs

@enduml
